  "worked_solution": "There are $(1\\,955÷23)\\,\\text{m}$ of fabric in each roll. We will use a box model to calculate this quotient.\n\nWe write our division this way:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"10\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"15\" align=\"right\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\">\n$23$\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"85\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"85\" align=\"center\">\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"85\" align=\"center\">\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\nSince $23\\times 50=1\\,150$ is less than $1\\,955,$ we subtract $23\\times 50$ from $1\\,955.$\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"10\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$50$</td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"15\" align=\"right\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\">\n$23$\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"85\" align=\"center\">\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"85\" align=\"center\">\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\nNext, we bring $805$ to the right.\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"10\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$50$</td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"15\" align=\"right\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\">\n$23$\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"30\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"85\" align=\"center\">\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\nSince $23\\times 30=690$ is less than $805,$ we subtract $23\\times 30$ from $805.$\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"10\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$50$</td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$30$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"15\" align=\"right\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\">\n$23$\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"30\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"85\" align=\"center\">\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\nNext, we bring $115$ to the right.\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"10\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$50$</td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$30$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"15\" align=\"right\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\">\n$23$\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"30\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"85\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\nFinally, since $23\\times 5=115$, we subtract $23\\times 5$ from $115.$\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"10\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$50$</td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$30$</td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"15\" align=\"right\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\">\n$23$\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"30\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"60\" height=\"85\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\boxed{\\text{0}}$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\nWe get $\\boxed{\\text{0}}$, so the division is done.\n\nThe quotient is the sum of the numbers on top of the boxes:\n\n$$\n50+30+5=85\n$$\n\nTherefore, each roll has $85\\,\\text{m}$ of fabric.",
